<title>UK: SBC unit sets 100 million mark exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>SBC unit sets 100 million mark exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Schweizerische Bankverein (Deutschland) AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWISS BANK CORP JERSEY BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     1.00	MATURITY  **15.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE  *EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  94.82     PAY DATE  L-28.FEB.97</p>
<p> YIELD	2.36	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> CONVERSION PRICE     2589.19 (19 PCT OVER FT-SE EUROTRACK 100)</p>
<p> CONVERSION RATIO     1.831 PER 5000 DEM</p>
<p> CONVERSION PERIOD    28.FEB.99-08.MAR.01</p>
<p> NOTES     *NOTE EXCHANGEABLE INTO FT-SE EUROTRACK 100INDEX</p>
<p>		L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>	    **CALLABLE FROM 15.MAR.99 TO MATURITY AT ACCRETED</p>
<p>		VALUE PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST ONLY IF CONVERSION</p>
<p>		PARITY OF THE INDEX CLOSES AT OR ABOVE 110 PCT OF</p>
<p>		THE INITIAL CONVERSION PRICE.</p>
<p>		SENIOR UNSECURED DEBT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
